      ],
      "text": "The README describes Agent Deck as a command center for managing many AI coding-agent sessions (such as Claude Code and OpenCode) from one terminal, with grouping, search, forking, git worktrees, cost tracking, and a phone-controlled conductor."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_70f4b0d5f44843c0dd4bc024cdcdb29bc44ff9c048174e8026a6843e8af78840",
