          "url": "https://github.com/asheshgoplani/agent-deck/blob/7d2302fb8a41c5fcab7a441d56729b4b6547885a/README.md#L323-L326"
        }
      ],
      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_1fb17e274f3e1521366e40c96e1353e970cca206d65ce36c916992e79058ed46",
        "slc_dede137c8ceb09bc1d6e3a89ac2e69e1d3cf421e5b1ea0411ee0452769916499"
      ],
      "text": "Documentation states each session's git worktree is an isolated working directory on its own branch, letting multiple agents work on one repository without conflicting, and a dedicated command merges the branch, removes the worktree, and deletes the session once a task is finished."
    },
    {
