        "slc_e68e5e883ce5c23a8fe49a3cf47d9c2924fcbde216dfd4f27877d2cab41da7f5"
      ],
      "text": "The documented Docker sandbox bind-mounts the project directory read-write into an isolated container and shares host tool authentication automatically, except that the macOS Claude Code login keeps its own sandbox credential to avoid disrupting the host's OAuth session."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_d6d8dad287b08e63c3f61e696b03bf72e1932f058303dfc12ba6a3c1034f29a8",
