        "slc_23cb215975a0046d18e607319b14f3b7dedebf55b2daed22a4c6b017f5912e96"
      ],
      "text": "Documentation states that inheriting sparse-checkout patterns into a new worktree requires Git 2.32 or newer, while the default, non-inheriting checkout behavior carries no such version requirement."
    },
